# Music is left out of the public repo on purpose: the GD soundtrack is 16
# complete songs by Waterflame, DJVI, F-777, MDK, DJ-Nate and Step, and those
# are the artists' work, not RobTop's to license. Same for any track you added
# yourself. They stay on your machine and the game just runs silent without
# them. To publish them anyway it is one command - see README.md.
assets-local/music/
music/*.mp3

# ...except the artist-cleared copies, which do ship with the public site.
!music/web/

# local like-server data
server/stats.json

.DS_Store
server/stats.json.bak*
